            .make("Slippers of Scampering", itemType: "Wondrous Item", price: "1,200 gp", weight: "1/2 lb.", slot: "feet",
                  aura: "faint transmutation", casterLevel: 4,
                  summary: "Slippers of scampering function in almost every way like slippers of spider climbing , except the slippers can be used f…",
                  desc: "Slippers of scampering function in almost every way like slippers of spider climbing , except the slippers can be used for 10 rounds per day, split up as the wearer chooses (minimum 1 round per use).",
